{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"RecurringPayments\">Recurring Payments</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Pending\">Pending</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Create Interval On Payment Payments RecurringPayment RecurringPayments To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The <strong>Recurring Payments</strong> screen manages scheduled payment transactions that are automatically created at regular intervals.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Expenses Is On Payment Payments Rent To ToDate\">Use this feature to set up automatic payments for regular expenses such as rent, insurance premiums, loan repayments, or subscription fees.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Automatic Import Never On Payment Payments Port Rate To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The system will automatically generate <em>payment</em> transactions based on the schedule you define, saving you time and ensuring important payments are never forgotten.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Amount And Count Payee Payment RecurringPayment\">Each recurring payment template specifies the <em>payee</em>, <em>amount</em>, <em>account</em>, and frequency of the payment.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div cl